                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-0 w-md-100 h-0"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="s_timeline_row position-relative d-flex gap-md-5 flex-column flex-md-row pb-4" data-name="Milestone">
                            <div class="o_dot_line position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0 mb-1 border-start pe-none"/>
                            <span class="o_dot o_not_editable position-absolute translate-middle-x rounded-circle pe-none" contenteditable="false"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-0 w-md-100 h-0"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-100 ps-4 ps-md-0">
                                <div class="s_timeline_card s_card card my-0 me-auto" style="border-width: 0px !important;" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Milestone Event">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h3 class="card-title">2023</h3>
                                        <p class="card-text">Ukko joins the line-up for riders who leave the pavement</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="s_timeline_row position-relative d-flex gap-md-5 flex-column flex-md-row pb-4" data-name="Milestone">
                            <div class="o_dot_line position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0 mb-1 border-start pe-none"/>
                            <span class="o_dot o_not_editable position-absolute translate-middle-x rounded-circle pe-none" contenteditable="false"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-100 ps-4 ps-md-0">
                                <div class="s_timeline_card s_card card my-0 ms-auto text-md-end" style="border-width: 0px !important;" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Milestone Event">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h3 class="card-title">2024</h3>
                                        <p class="card-text">Indra launches for city commuters, with removable batteries</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-0 w-md-100 h-0"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="s_timeline_row position-relative d-flex gap-md-5 flex-column flex-md-row pb-4" data-name="Milestone">
                            <div class="o_dot_line position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0 mb-1 border-start pe-none"/>
                            <span class="o_dot o_not_editable position-absolute translate-middle-x rounded-circle pe-none" contenteditable="false"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-0 w-md-100 h-0"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-100 ps-4 ps-md-0">
                                <div class="s_timeline_card s_card card my-0 me-auto" style="border-width: 0px !important;" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Milestone Event">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h3 class="card-title">2025</h3>
                                        <p class="card-text">K'awiil Financing launches: in-house loans with online applications</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="s_timeline_row position-relative d-flex gap-md-5 flex-column flex-md-row pb-4" data-name="Milestone">
                            <div class="o_dot_line position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0 mb-1 border-start pe-none"/>
                            <span class="o_dot o_not_editable position-absolute translate-middle-x rounded-circle pe-none" contenteditable="false"/>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-100 ps-4 ps-md-0">
                                <div class="s_timeline_card s_card card my-0 ms-auto text-md-end" style="border-width: 0px !important;" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Milestone Event">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h3 class="card-title">2026</h3>
                                        <p class="card-text">Move to the new assembly and service workshop on Thunderbird Road, Dogpatch</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="s_timeline_content w-0 w-md-100 h-0"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- 4. What we stand for -->
            <section class="s_three_columns o_cc o_cc1 pt112 pb112" data-vxml="001" data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_three_columns" data-name="Columns">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2>What we stand for</h2>
                    <div class="row d-flex align-items-stretch">
                        <div data-name="Card" class="col-lg-4 pt16 pb16">
                            <div class="s_card card h-100 o_cc o_cc1 my-0 border" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Card" style="--box-border-top-width: 3px; --box-border-right-width: 0px; --box-border-bottom-width: 0px; --box-border-left-width: 0px; border-color: var(--o-color-5) !important;">
                                <div class="card-body px-0">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Performance first</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">We build bikes people want to ride, then make them clean. Not the other way round.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-name="Card" class="col-lg-4 pt16 pb16">
                            <div class="s_card card h-100 o_cc o_cc1 my-0 border" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Card" style="--box-border-top-width: 3px; --box-border-right-width: 0px; --box-border-bottom-width: 0px; --box-border-left-width: 0px; border-color: var(--o-color-5) !important;">
