                                    <h3 class="card-title">Built and serviced here</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">Every bike is assembled and serviced in San Francisco by the people who designed it.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-name="Card" class="col-lg-4 pt16 pb16">
                            <div class="s_card card h-100 o_cc o_cc1 my-0 border" data-vxml="001" data-snippet="s_card" data-name="Card" style="--box-border-top-width: 3px; --box-border-right-width: 0px; --box-border-bottom-width: 0px; --box-border-left-width: 0px; border-color: var(--o-color-5) !important;">
                                <div class="card-body px-0">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Ownership made simple</h3>
